  "sn22.87:1.1": "",
  "sn22.87:1.2": "Vakkali’s verses describe his perseverance in the face of illness (<a href='https://suttacentral.net/thag5.8/en/sujato'>Thag 5.8</a>), for which he was said to be the foremost in commitment to faith (<a href='https://suttacentral.net/an1.208/en/sujato'>AN 1.208</a>, <a href='https://suttacentral.net/snp5.19/en/sujato#16.1'>Snp 5.19:16.1</a>). | Text has <i lang='pi' translate='no'>nivesana</i>, normally “house”, as also at <a href='https://suttacentral.net/pli-tv-kd10/en/sujato#2.3.11'>Kd 10:2.3.11</a>. <a href='https://suttacentral.net/mn140/en/sujato#3.2'>MN 140:3.2</a> has the expected <i lang='pi' translate='no'>āvesana</i>, “workshop”. ",
