  "sn22.87:8.36": "Compare Godhika at <a href='https://suttacentral.net/sn4.23/en/sujato#2.3'>SN 4.23:2.3</a>, Channa at <a href='https://suttacentral.net/mn144/en/sujato#13.11'>MN 144:13.11</a> = <a href='https://suttacentral.net/sn35.87/en/sujato'>SN 35.87</a>, and notes at <a href='https://suttacentral.net/mn145/en/sujato#5.32'>MN 145:5.32</a> and <a href='https://suttacentral.net/pli-tv-bu-vb-pj3/en/sujato#2.49.1'>Bu Pj 3:2.49.1</a> = <a href='https://suttacentral.net/sn54.9/en/sujato'>SN 54.9</a>. ",
